{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "DS Ozon 采集助手",
  "version": "1.7.8",
  "description": "在正常的 Chrome 里采集 Ozon 商品数据（标题/价格/主图/类目/评论等），并上报到 ds 选品系统；也支持在 1688 货品页抓价格/重量/尺寸，一键回填到 ds 核价页。新增「记一笔」自采购备忘录：看到想卖的品随手记下 1688 链接，存到后台自采购页。不依赖调试模式，不受反爬挑战影响。",
  "permissions": ["storage", "tabs", "scripting", "activeTab"],
  "host_permissions": [
    "https://www.ozon.ru/*",
    "https://*.ozon.ru/*",
    "https://*.1688.com/*",
    "http://localhost:3101/*",
    "http://127.0.0.1:3101/*",
    "http://localhost:3100/*",
    "http://127.0.0.1:3100/*",
    "http://ozon.qinxianty.com/*",
    "http://114.132.99.141/*"
  ],
  "background": {
    "service_worker": "background.js",
    "type": "module"
  },
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": [
        "http://localhost:3100/*",
        "http://127.0.0.1:3100/*",
        "http://ozon.qinxianty.com/*",
        "http://114.132.99.141/*"
      ],
      "js": ["identity-bridge.js"],
      "run_at": "document_idle"
    }
  ],
  "action": {
    "default_popup": "popup.html",
    "default_title": "DS 采集助手"
  },
  "options_ui": {
    "page": "rules.html",
    "open_in_tab": true
  }
}
